WEBVTT

00:56:28.070 --> 00:56:31.466
These are vaccines that you can test,
get them all ready,

00:56:31.490 --> 00:56:34.397
and then, when a new organism occurs,
you can put it in there

00:56:34.421 --> 00:56:37.081
and you know how to manufacture it,
how to scale it up.

00:56:37.105 --> 00:56:40.246
These types of things can be done.
CEPI is trying to do that now.

00:56:40.270 --> 00:56:41.634
But the challenge is,

00:56:41.658 --> 00:56:43.832
if we, a year after this,

00:56:43.856 --> 00:56:47.418
go down to having no money
available for these types of issues,

00:56:47.442 --> 00:56:48.605
that will be a problem.

00:56:48.629 --> 00:56:50.469
So what you need is citizens to say,

00:56:50.493 --> 00:56:52.023
"I understand now

00:56:52.047 --> 00:56:54.352
that health is precious,

00:56:54.376 --> 00:56:57.258
and I want my government, my leaders

00:56:57.282 --> 00:57:00.468
to invest in this, in the science,